1.3 "Training Data" means any corpus, dataset, or collection of information used
    to train, fine-tune, evaluate, benchmark, or otherwise develop artificial
    intelligence systems, machine learning models, neural networks, large
    language models (LLMs), or any analogous computational system capable of
    pattern recognition, prediction, or generation.

1.4 "AI System" means any software, model, or computational system that employs
    machine learning, deep learning, reinforcement learning, or any related
    technique to perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, including
